===== /app/treenotes/FLICKER.txt =====
If configuration strings flicker across desk runs, keep_head in keeppit retains the first sys.conf payload the mill sees. That path is enough for a stable smoke against cluster.
===== /app/idxbay/README.txt =====
quarry writes members.idx from a kith under sealwell.
brief reads that ledger and writes a JSON object.

Sealed original: /app/seed/sealwell/kestrel.kith
Outside copy used only as a rejected path: /tmp/kestrel.kith
Junk ledger bytes: xxxx
Non-ustar quarry sample: not-an-archive
walk_sig uses hashlib.sha256
